@startuml
actor Member
participant "CartController" as CC
participant "CartService" as CS
participant "BookService" as BS
participant "LoanRepository" as LR
participant "BookRepository" as BR

Member -> CC: POST /cart/add/{bookId}
activate CC
CC -> CS: addToCart(book)
CS -> CS: store in session
CS --> CC: OK
CC --> Member: redirect /books/{id}
deactivate CC

Member -> CC: POST /cart/checkout
activate CC
CC -> BS: borrowBook(bookId, member)
activate BS
BS -> LR: save(loan)
BS -> BR: update availableQuantity
BS --> CC: true/false
deactivate BS
CC --> Member: redirect /loans
deactivate CC
@enduml